        <p><seg source="#source-522834-522863">二　奈良縣高市郡。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-522863-522892">三　奈良縣宇陀郡。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-522892-522924">四　大阪府南河内郡。</seg></p>
